      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Dvalin: Stormterror Crisis (Prologue)",
      "content": "The Prologue arc in which Dvalin, corrupted by Abyssal poison and by grief at being forgotten, attacked Mondstadt. Venti, the Traveler, Jean and Diluc broke the Abyssal blood clots at Decarabian's tower and freed him. Jean afterwards told the city the truth.\n\nThe Fatui had pressured the Knights into silence about Stormterror's real identity and treated him as leverage. Mondstadt's elemental flow was disordered during the crisis.",
