      "comment": "Dvalin: Durin and the Cataclysm",
      "content": "Five hundred years ago the black dragon Durin descended on Mondstadt. Dvalin, summoned by Barbatos' lyre, tore out Durin's throat but swallowed its poisonous blood, which cursed him for centuries. Durin's remains lie in Dragonspine. The reborn Durin later became Dvalin's friend.",
