      "key": [
        "Wolvendom",
        "Boreas",
        "Varka"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dvalin"
      ],
      "comment": "Dvalin: Flight to Nod-Krai",
      "content": "When fallout from Nod-Krai reached Mondstadt and Boreas, Venti offered Dvalin to carry the Traveler to Nod-Krai to help Varka; he said Dvalin had room for only one person and a small companion. Boreas imbued Razor's claymore with his power for the journey. Over Dreadshade Mire Dvalin said the Knight of Boreas awaited below and that he and Barbatos had other plans, and the Traveler leapt from his back.",
